      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 31 · AI Interview Scheduler\nProposes interview slots from interviewer availability, books the calendar event and emails the candidate.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/interview-scheduler` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Calendar OAuth2, OpenAI API.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Neha Gupta\",\n \"email\": \"neha@example.com\",\n \"role\": \"Senior Backend Engineer\",\n \"candidate_preferences\": \"weekday afternoons\",\n \"interviewer_availability\": [\n  \"2026-11-12T14:00:00+05:30\",\n  \"2026-11-13T16:00:00+05:30\"\n ]\n}\n```"
      }
